# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: gantt-no-duplicate-title >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gantt-no-duplicate-title.md incorrect 1
Filename: gantt-no-duplicate-title-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   title first
  3 |   title second
    |   ^~~~~~~~~~~~ [1]
  4 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  5 |   Design :2024-01-06, 3d
  6 |

[1] mermaid.js replaces the earlier title with the one of this `title`.
    Suggestions:
      - Remove this statement.
        Output:
          1 | gantt
          2 |   title first
          3 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
          4 |   Design :2024-01-06, 3d
          5 |
      - Remove the earlier statement that sets the title.
        Output:
          1 | gantt
          2 |   title second
          3 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
          4 |   Design :2024-01-06, 3d
          5 |
---


